entries[273814] = { ["name"] = "Follower: Falstad Wildhammer" }
entries[273815] = { ["name"] = "Croak Crock", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nDuring times of war, the Zandalari faced off against many powerful foes. Some, even, that they could not break. Their witchdoctors devised these cursed pots and through the use of powerful magic, summoned them at different locations within the enemy's encampment. Shortly after, a fountain of frogs would spring forth, causing a ruckus and confusing the enemy in the process. Little did they know that these frogs carried a plague with them that would quickly devastate their ranks and force them to retreat or surrender.\nCroak Crock\nBinds when picked up\nToy\nUse: Summon a plague of toads. (10 Min Cooldown)\n\"Used to plague those who dared to cross the Zandalari.\"" }
entries[273816] = { ["name"] = "Follower: Arcanist Valtrois" }
entries[273817] = { ["name"] = "Intact Direhorn Hatchling", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nThe Zandalari are regarded for their beast taming, and one of their greatest allies is that of the direhorn. Plated skin, with spikes protruding from various directions, this creature offered both protection for istelf and that of its master. It was custom for its future master to be the first to see it when it broke free from its shell.surrender.\nIntact Direhorn Egg\nBinds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to summon and dismiss a Direhorn Hatchling\nRight Click to summon and dismiss the Direhorn Hatchling.\n1 to 80 ( 80)" }
entries[273818] = { ["name"] = "Child of Rezan" }
entries[273819] = { ["name"] = "Sanguinating Totem", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nAfter the great plague, there were still those who clung to the magics of the blood god. They tested their magics and perfected them. One such relic was a totem, which when concentrated upon, would drain not just the life from their enemies, but also their blood, infusing the caster with it and altering them in unusual ways. This was the dawn of who the Zandalari call, \"The Blood Trolls\".\nSanguinating Totem\nBinds to Warband\nUnique-EquippedTrinket\n+6 Stamina\nUse: Drains health from an enemy, transferring it to the caster. (1 Min, 30 Sec Cooldown)\n45" }
